// Standard I/O + awaitable sockets for the event loop.
//
// File helpers (host):
//   io.in(path) / io.out(path, text) / io.append(path, text)
//
// Sockets (blocking if called without ~>; awaitable under ~~> with ~>):
//   fd = io.connect(host, port)
//   n  = ~> io.send(fd, data)
//   s  = ~> io.recv(fd)
//   ~> io.wait(ms)
//   io.close(fd)
//
// Prefer ~~> handlers + ~> for concurrent I/O; use plain calls for simple scripts.

// These are host-backed; signatures document the surface for use std.io / use std.io.*

